OneZip builds on the following open-source projects, used as Cargo dependencies:

- HatchZip (hatchzip-core) — https://github.com/xevrion/hatchzip
  Licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0.
  The optional `rar` feature compiles UnRAR source code, which is under its own
  license (see LICENSE-UNRAR in the HatchZip repository). It is not enabled by default.

- Peel (peel-rs) — https://github.com/agouin/peel
  Copyright (c) 2026 Andrew Gouin. Licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0.
  Its RAR5 decoder references libarchive (BSD 2-Clause); see Peel's NOTICE.

Planned: NanaZip / 7-Zip (7z.dll), loaded dynamically — MIT (NanaZip) and
LGPL-2.1 with the unRAR restriction (7-Zip). See docs/设计方案.md §10.
